{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1363742-question-for-technocracy-experts","id":1363742,"title":"Question for Technocracy experts","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-01-27T23:03:58-08:00","id":1363742,"title":"Question for Technocracy experts","content":"(<b>If this post seems to soon the Mods are perfectly in line to delete or lock my post</b>)<br /> <br /> The whole Kobe Bryant death is tragic and has many people floored around the world. I never really cared for basketball, but even with that Kobe was a known American icon for generally everyone. After his death ALOT of conspiracy theories are pouring out regarding Gametria, hollywood sacrifices, &quot;Predictive Programming&quot;, etc. Now putting this through the lens of the WoD universe, would the Technocracy be really behind alot of rituals us in the real world allude to the illumaniti? Because we know that the Technocracy basically <i>is</i> the illumaniti for WoD, but it would seem out of place for the Technocracy to things like this.<br /> <br /> In WoD, the Technocracy is all about smuttering out reality deviations and keeping the Tellurium relatively static. The things the &quot;illumaniti&quot; (if it actually exists) in our world seem to do things that the Technocracy wouldn't do.. Celebrity sacrifices, Mystic contracts that soar your career among the Asleep masses, worship of extraneous dimensional entities etc. Though the &quot;illumaniti&quot;/world wide cabal in our does things that would align with the Technocracy according to the various rumors stoked for years: Cloned celebrities/officials, subliminal messaging in various forms of media, &quot;Predictive Programming&quot; in certain forms of televised or movie media where an event that was predicted in the moment occurs years later (similar to how the WoD Technocracy had an outline of progress for every year to push the consensus in an organized way), psyop operations, etc.<br /> <br /> Generally my question is that would the WoD Technocracy do the things our &quot;World Wide Cabal&quot; commonly &quot;does&quot;? Things like ritual sacrifice, disposal of particular influencers at the *right* exact moment, operating clandestine trafficking rings (in reference to the whole Epstein debacle in our &quot;world&quot;), utilizing advantageous Clones, funding operations through a world-wide banking syndicate (kinda like the actual Syndicate), consorting with extradimensional entities (the rumors of the high echelons of society consorting with Demons), teasing the unAwakened masses with complex codes and iconography insigniae, blood ties, the Vatican (since the Order of Reason included the Templars I believe in WoD) etc.<br /> <br /> I just generally ask this question because when I first heard about Mage and started getting into it, I instantly noticed how close the Technocracy was the particular &quot;Society&quot; spoken about by various conspiracist nutters around the net, also especially with the Technocratic faction &quot;<b><i>New World Order</i></b>&quot;. Though as I got deeper into the lore of the Mage gameline I realized half the stuff our &quot;World-Wide cabal Society&quot; does wouldn't align with the Technocracy.. But when I learned that the Nephandi heavily infiltrated the Technocracy, my muse began to spin. What do you think?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":25523,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","user":"Shakanaka","date":". 01-28-2020, 02:32 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-27T23:24:13-08:00","id":1363744,"title":"","content":"Well, I'm something of a Technocracy expert \u2014 but unfortunately, I'm not much of a World Wide Cabal expert. So while I could confirm our deny things the Union might be into, I can't address the other half of the issue you raise. <br /> <br /> Even with the Technocracy though, there are a few complication factors. First, the Technocracy isn't monolithic. You have the various Conventions, each of which has its own focus and flaws; and you've got the divide between Control and the field ops. <br /> <br /> But second, there have been multiple interpretations of the Technocracy over the years; and exactly what they would and wouldn't condone tends to vary from one interpretation to the next.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-27T23:39:15-08:00","id":1363746,"title":"","content":"Alright. How would you rule the use of ritual sacrifices, pact with Celebrities (maybe as a tool-rote in somesort of mystic Primal Utility), using dark arts, consorting with extradimensional entities. I know the Technocracy has a hardline against those things, but what Convention is mostlikely to utilize those for their agendas? Also how would the greater Technocracy try to reign in this rogue portion of the Technocracy?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-28T05:01:23-08:00","id":1363773,"title":"","content":"In my opinion, the &quot;Illuminaty conspiracy&quot; in WoD could be how the masses (or certain groups within the masses, and other &quot;outsiders&quot;) perceive the high level political machinations of mages in general. Imbued Hunters call mages &quot;controllers&quot; for a reason.<br /> <br /> The Technocracy it's part of it, in the sense that there's really a cabal of rich people influencing the politicians (and, sometimes, consorting with aliens. VE aren't all &quot;shot first and ask latter&quot;, in spite of their reputation). They wouldn't <i>usually </i>do ritual human sacrifices (at least not in a fashion most people would recognize as a human sacrifice) nor use the &quot;dark arts&quot;...but rich Nephandi would do all of that...And rich Hermetics would use their influence to build obelisks and pyramids in order to channel Quintessence inside the cities where they have their Chantries following their esoteric knowledge preserved from the egyptians...<br /> <br /> If you see all of that from the pov of a mage hunter (Imbued or otherwise): there's no way for the witness to know that these three rich men in suits using esoteric knowledge to influence humanity behind the curtains belong to different factions, unless one sees them figthing directly (which it's unusual at this level of influence). Much less that they have different beliefs.<br /> <br /> A mage hunter, thus, could easily think that there's a cabal of rich people that manipulates international politics, do human sacrifices, commune with aliens and build egyptian-looking structures to gather energy. Heck, he may not be wrong: If you want a group that could potentially fill all the Illuminaty dots by itself: Nephandi (Mammonites?) can do all of that. So, there's that<br /> <br /> Illuminaty conspiracies based arround the mage world (that is, when the crackpot theory actually points to magely business) could be either Tech-nephandy or, more likely, outsiders seeing the Ascencion War w/o fully understanding who is who.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1683,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","user":"Aleph","date":". 01-28-2020, 08:28 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-28T05:59:21-08:00","id":1363780,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shakanaka</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1363742-question-for-technocracy-experts#post1363742\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(<b>If this post seems to soon the Mods are perfectly in line to delete or lock my post</b>)<br /> <br /> Things like ritual sacrifice, disposal of particular influencers at the *right* exact moment, operating clandestine trafficking rings (in reference to the whole Epstein debacle in our &quot;world&quot;), utilizing advantageous Clones, funding operations through a world-wide banking syndicate (kinda like the actual Syndicate), consorting with extradimensional entities (the rumors of the high echelons of society consorting with Demons), teasing the unAwakened masses with complex codes and iconography insigniae, blood ties, the Vatican (since the Order of Reason included the Templars I believe in WoD) etc.</div> </div> </div> </div>No, yes, yes, yes, yes, complicated, mostly not, no, not anymore.<br /> <br /> Ritual sacrifice is completely unscientific. Consorting with demons is as well, but the Technocracy does do a lot in the Umbra and there are some entities there they will work with at least for the time being. Only a few technocrats would be so tacky as to tease the masses, but puzzles are a good way of seeking out potential new recruits.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: The Ice-ension: An Epic Game of Reality on the Rink","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/758-ramnesis","name":"Ramnesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2220"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}